  <prompt>Close out spaarke-notification-spine-r1: run the final quality gates across all project code, reconcile tests per ADR-038 §7, finalize ADR-047 (full) and its CHANGELOG entries, finalize the outbox docs/data-model entry, run repo-cleanup, verify every graduation criterion in README.md, and transition README/plan/TASK-INDEX to Complete with a lessons-learned writeup.</prompt>

  <role>SPAARKE platform developer. Follow ADRs strictly. Expert in project-closure governance (root CLAUDE.md §7 task-transition rules, §8 test-diet gate, ADR-038 §7 build-vs-maintain classifier) and in synthesizing a multi-phase project's outcome into its permanent documentation artifacts.</role>

  <goal>Every graduation criterion in `README.md` is checked off with a verification pointer; `/code-review` and `/adr-check` have run against the full set of project-touched code (Phases 0-5) with findings resolved or explicitly accepted per the ADR Conflict Resolution Protocol (root CLAUDE.md §6.5); `/test-diet` has reconciled every test added/modified during the project (MAINTAIN kept, SCAFFOLDING removed) with its report at `notes/test-diet-report.md`; ADR-047's full version at `docs/adr/ADR-047-notification-action-spine.md` is finalized (reflecting the FR-01 mode decision and any deviations discovered during Phases 1-5) with its `.claude/adr/INDEX.md` row updated to `Accepted`; the outbox table's `docs/data-model/` entry is finalized with its real name/column set (as created at task 011); `/repo-cleanup` has run; `README.md` status is `Complete`, `plan.md` status is `Complete`, every task in `tasks/TASK-INDEX.md` shows ✅; and `notes/lessons-learned.md` exists.</goal>

  <context>
    <background>
      This is the terminal task of the Spaarke Notification &amp; Action Spine — R1 project (spec.md, plan.md Phase 6). It follows Phase 0 (gate-zero spike), Phase 1 (Layer B + contract + ADR-047 concise), Phase 2 (Layer C + communication-arrived, unblocking messaging-r3), Phase 3 (Layer A + Notification flip), Phase 4 (comms-RI producer + policy), and Phase 5 (suggestion consumer, tasks 050-052). Per root CLAUDE.md §7's project-close test-diet gate, `/test-diet` MUST run before this task marks the project complete — it is read-only and emits `git rm`/`git mv` commands for reviewer execution, it does not auto-execute. Per root CLAUDE.md §3, `.claude/` writes (including `.claude/adr/ADR-047-notification-action-spine.md`'s status update and `.claude/adr/INDEX.md`) are main-session-only — this task runs main-session, not as a delegated sub-agent, consistent with how task 010 authored the ADR-047 concise version.
    </background>
    <relevant-files>
      <file>projects/spaarke-notification-spine-r1/README.md</file>
