  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">All 21 dependency tasks (001,010,011,012,013,020,021,022,023,024,025,030,031,032,033,040,041,042,050,051,052) show ✅ in tasks/TASK-INDEX.md before this task begins its own work.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">/code-review and /adr-check have run against the full project diff; every finding is resolved (fixed), cited against an existing ADR Tension (Path A), or escalated as an amendment candidate (Path B) — none are silently unaddressed.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">/test-diet has produced notes/test-diet-report.md and its reviewer-approved git rm/git mv commands have been executed; no SCAFFOLDING-classified test from this project remains.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">docs/adr/ADR-047-notification-action-spine.md exists as a finalized full ADR reflecting the FR-01 mode decision and the ADR-043 Notification-flip Path-C resolution; .claude/adr/INDEX.md's ADR-047 row shows a terminal Accepted status; a corresponding entry exists in .claude/CHANGELOG.md.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">The outbox table has a finalized docs/data-model/ entry using its real (task-011-decided) table and column names — not placeholder names.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">/repo-cleanup has run for the project with no unresolved hygiene findings.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Every graduation-criteria checkbox in README.md and every Success Criteria item in spec.md is checked with a concrete verification pointer (test name, file path, or note reference) — none is checked without one.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">README.md status line reads Complete; plan.md status reads Complete; tasks/TASK-INDEX.md shows ✅ for all 22 tasks (21 dependencies + 090 itself).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">notes/lessons-learned.md exists and names concrete outcomes for each of the three sibling-project coordination points (messaging-r3 unblock, spaarkeai-assistant-enhancements-r1 R1.5 absorption, spaarke-daily-update-service-r5 coordination) — not generic "went well" statements.</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>

  <notes>
    Plan.md Phase 6 deliverables list is the authoritative checklist for this task's scope: ADR-047 full + CHANGELOG, /test-diet reconciliation, docs/data-model outbox entry, lessons-learned, README status. Root CLAUDE.md §7's binding test-diet gate applies because this IS a `090-wrapup-*`-equivalent task (project-close). If /test-diet or /repo-cleanup is skipped for any reason, that is a HARD WARNING per root CLAUDE.md §7 — the wrap-up notes MUST cite the report or document the skip rationale explicitly, never silently.
  </notes>

